  m_text: Almond casts spells, clicking one of the selected spells from the bottom
    of the screen. Spells require pips to cast; the more powerful the spell, the
    more pips needed. Once the spell is selected, the range will be highlighted on
    the map in a dark purple. Once a valid target is selected, the spell's area of
    effect is highlighted in a light pink. To finish casting the spell, click the
    confirm button in the bottom right.
